9.1 Limitations on Debt. Directly or indirectly create, incur, assume or
otherwise become or remain liable with respect to any Debt or any Guaranties
except:

9.1.5  foreign currency agreements in an aggregate notional amount not
                to exceed $3,000,000 (after netting contracts to buy and sell
                the same national currency on the same date);

13.1.1 Default shall be made in the due and punctual payment of any
     principal of any Note when and as the same shall become due and payable,
     whether at maturity or by acceleration or otherwise;
